     5	1. **δ units.** The success margin is a **relative** pooled-EE gain: EE_FULL / EE_DROP − 1 ≥ +0.5 % (the phrase "+0.5 pp" in v1.2 §4 meant this relative percentage; pooled EE has no percentage-point scale). The 95 % lower bound of that relative gain must exceed +0.5 %.
