     1	# V025 priority declaration — v1.4 erratum (controller, sealed before any formal successor outcome; 2026-09-08 ≈ 18:15 UTC)
     2	
     3	v1.0–v1.3 are preserved unchanged. This erratum fixes two ambiguities found by pipeline audit C; it changes no design, order or constant.
     4	
     5	1. **δ units.** The success margin is a **relative** pooled-EE gain: EE_FULL / EE_DROP − 1 ≥ +0.5 % (the phrase "+0.5 pp" in v1.2 §4 meant this relative percentage; pooled EE has no percentage-point scale). The 95 % lower bound of that relative gain must exceed +0.5 %.
