    24	### Three numerators
    25	
    26	Each user's 48 boundary values were trapezoid-integrated over 47 × 0.640 s = 30.08 s first. The 1.504 Gbit cap or attainment filter was then applied per user-anchor, followed by pooling across users and all eight anchors.
