11. **Standby inventory (D-N3, provider T3/D4; ENGINE):** for the P_idle sensitivity each satellite carries a declared 12-RF-chain census (`VERIFY_SOURCE`; matches the f = 1/12 sensitivity); idle chains = 12 − active beams (≥ 0); the primary P_idle = 0 is unaffected; standby no longer depends on the realisable-cell count.
