    31	
    32	This is an exact compact enumeration: every calendar date in that inclusive span is available except these 17 dates:
    33	
    34	`2025-08-02`, `2025-08-07`, `2025-08-22`, `2025-09-17`, `2025-10-18`, `2025-10-25`, `2025-11-09`, `2026-01-12`, `2026-02-25`, `2026-03-04`, `2026-03-14`, `2026-03-15`, `2026-06-17`, `2026-06-21`, `2026-06-30`, `2026-07-25`, `2026-08-04`.
