     7	## Status
     8	
     9	The reusable pieces are in `src/mcrl/stagec_v025/c3_panel.py`; the branch exercise is `scripts/run_c3_panel_smoke.py`; and the read-only sealed-rule bridge is `scripts/run_c3_rule_evaluator.py`. Contract tests are in `tests/stagec_v025/test_c3_panel_harness.py`.
