    31	The successful smoke trained two source epochs using the first already-declared `LEARNER_SEEDS` entry. It recorded 2 updates for each of C1, C2 and C3 in each of the eight learned arms, and `all_learned_arms_retain_update_deploy_all_heads=true`. This is branch coverage only.
