/home/sat/mcrl-v025-c1c2-ws/V025-PILOT-MIN-REPORT-2026-09-09.md:132:- Exact full-network C1/C2 evaluation for every shortlisted source action exceeded the compute ceiling. The completed schema retains every required action row but derives Q1/C1/C2 from the provider's real boundary-0 link primitives; exact nominal physics is retained for each selected C3 identity, and realised 48-boundary physics is retained for every committed evaluation profile. These approximate source labels are PILOT_NOT_CLAIM.
