17:I used **eight real anchors**, fixed before results: `V025_PROBE_R2` worlds 1–2, steps 0–3. Anchor IDs and world-tape SHA-256 values are identical between rules. Selection uses realised boundary 0 held for 30.08 s and the exact binary64-derived Fraction objective `F = bits − 19720681.00172232 × joules`; committed reporting reevaluates the chosen configurations over all 48 realised boundaries. Pooled EE is `sum(bits)/sum(joules)`, never a mean of anchor ratios.
